# Normalise to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# This project is authored on Windows but built on macOS for iOS, and Metro,
# Babel and Prettier all assume LF. Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` on a
# Windows clone checks files out with CRLF and every formatter run shows the
# whole file as changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated; collapse it in diffs and reviews.
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true -diff

# Binary assets: never touch, never diff.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.m4a binary
*.opus binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp4 binary
